    + exact run_ovf_0RB1LA_1LC1RD_1RB1RD_1RC0LA.
    + reflexivity.
    + reflexivity.
    + exact (gso_0RB1LA_1LC1RD_1RB1RD_1RC0LA p j' E).
    + exact (geo_0RB1LA_1LC1RD_1RB1RD_1RC0LA p j' E).
    + lia.
