    apply (fire_via_ovf_lift tm Cc Hi (StD, S0)).
    intros p1 j1 E1. apply (fire_lift_of_csteps tm Cc).
    apply (fireo_0RB1LA_1RC0LA_0RD1RB_0LD1LB [SCycL 2 0; SWin 4; SWinL 2] (StD, S0) ltac:(vm_compute; reflexivity)
