Lemma run_int_0RB1LA_1RC0LA_1LA1RD_1RC0LA : srun tm false true chi_0RB1LA_1RC0LA_1LA1RD_1RC0LA A0_0RB1LA_1RC0LA_1LA1RD_1RC0LA = Some (A1_0RB1LA_1RC0LA_1LA1RD_1RC0LA, 4, 8).
Proof. vm_compute. reflexivity. Qed.

