    intros p1 j1 E1.
    exact (firex_0RB1LA_1RC0LA_1RD1RB_1LB0LC [SCycL 2 0; SWin 4] (StD, S1) ltac:(vm_compute; reflexivity)
                   p1 j1 E1).
Qed.

